# DevOpsAI Wiki - Git Ignore Rules

# Exclude User Content and Documentation Files
docs/**/*.md
!docs/README.md

# Exclude User Persistent Data (Kanban, Quick Notes, Task Templates)
data/
*.json.bak

# Exclude User Uploaded Images
public/images/*
!public/images/.gitkeep

# Node.js & Temporary Files
node_modules/
npm-debug.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.log

# Zmienne srodowiskowe - nigdy nie wersjonowac w Git
.env
.env.local
.env.production
